    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>Diseases are viruses and other organisms that attack the immune systems of living creatures. Disease Hazards always attack the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> of a target, ignoring <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonuses to a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>, a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a>, and a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a>. </p><p>They cause <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Conditions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Conditions\">Persistent Conditions</a> if they move a target down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> cannot be removed until the Disease is cured (see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> for more details), or until the Disease fails its attack roll against a target twice. Unlike other Hazards, some Diseases may require special <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> or medicine to treat. </p><p>Diseases affect only living creatures; <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a> are immune. Airborne Diseases are considered Atmospheric Hazards. </p><table class=\"sortable wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DISEASE </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>KEYWORDS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\">Saga Edition Core Rulebook </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cardooine_Chills\" title=\"Cardooine Chills\">Cardooine Chills</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Disease, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Krytos_Virus\" title=\"Krytos Virus\">Krytos Virus</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 5 </td> \n   <td>Artificial, Atmosphere, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rakghoul_Disease\" title=\"Rakghoul Disease\">Rakghoul Disease</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 6 </td> \n   <td>Contact, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vongspawn\" title=\"Vongspawn\">Vongspawn</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 6 </td> \n   <td>Contact, Disease </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Jedi Academy Training Manual</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Death_Seed_Plague\" title=\"Death Seed Plague\">Death Seed Plague</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>Disease </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
